# AI Quotation Maker - Root Environment Configuration Overview
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy the respective templates into the backend/ and frontend/ folders:
#
# Backend (Server-Side Only - NEVER expose to frontend):
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#
# Frontend (Client-Side Safe):
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env
#
# Refer to backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for granular variables.
